          "node01.text": "1 · What",
          "node02.text": "The offer and what you keep",
          "node03.text": "Close slips because reconciliations, approvals and journal entries run in sequence. We map the close, remove the longest delays and put a five-day target calendar in place, so Finance spends days on analysis, not on chasing.",
